<footer class="bg-black text-white py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">{{t $.Lang "footer.furubira_town_tourism_association"}}</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">{{t $.Lang "footer.furubira_is_a_fishing_town_located_on_the_sea_of_japan_coast_of_hokkaido_here_we_introduce_the_charms_woven_together_by_its_traditions_and_natural_beauty"}}</p></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4">{{t $.Lang "footer.tourist_information"}}</h4><nav class="space-y-2"><div><a href="/en/spots" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "header.tourist_spot"}}</a></div><div><a href="/en/accommodations" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "header.accommodations"}}</a></div><div><a href="/en/dining" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "header.restaurants"}}</a></div><div><a href="/en/events" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "header.events"}}</a></div><div><a href="/en/shopping" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "header.shopping"}}</a></div><div><a href="/en/access" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "home.access"}}</a></div><div><a href="/en/furusato" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">Tax Donation </a></div></nav><div class="mt-6"><h5 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-300">{{t $.Lang "footer.further_links"}}</h5><div class="space-y-2"><div><a href="https://www.town.furubira.lg.jp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "footer.furubira_town"}}</a></div><div><a href="https://www.furubira-tarakomuseum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{t $.Lang "footer.michi_no_eki_furubira_tarako_museum_roadside_station"}}</a></div></div></div></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4">{{t $.Lang "footer.contact_us"}}</h4><div class="space-y-2"><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone h-4 w-4"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>0135-48-9840<br>(役場総合政策課産業連携室商工観光係)</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg>shoukankou@town.furubira.lg.jp</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-4 w-4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>Weekdays 8:45~17:30</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-2">〒046-0192<br>北海道古平郡古平町大字浜町50番地</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-800 text-center"><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">© {{boundary}}2026{{boundary}} Furubira Town Tourism Association. All rights reserved.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">{{t $.Lang "footer.the_image_of_the_tengu_fire_walking_ritual_was_taken_by_yuya_instagram"}}<a href="https://www.instagram.com/yuya_7photo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors">Yuya (Instagram)</a></p></div></div></footer>